OL,3,GNEWSAMinisters vow online safety action
OL,4,Aafter teen sextortion victim took own
OL,5,Alife
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK government has said it remains
OL,8,Fcommitted to making the online world as
OL,9,Fsafe as possible for young people
OL,10,Ffollowing the death of a teenager who
OL,11,Ftook his own life after he fell victim
OL,12,Fto an online sextortion scam.
OL,14,FCai Davies, 18, died in June 2025 after
OL,15,Fhe had sent messages to a woman he
OL,16,Fbelieved had a romantic interest in
OL,17,Fhim.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
