OL,3,GNEWSAMinisters vow online safety action
OL,4,Aafter teen sextortion victim took own
OL,5,Alife
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Wales Central Coroner's Court
OL,8,Fheard he had been targeted by scammers
OL,9,Foperating from Africa, who demanded
OL,10,Fmoney from him and said intimate photos
OL,11,Fwould be sent to his friends and posted
OL,12,Fon YouTube.
OL,14,FThe coroner addressed a Regulation 28
OL,15,Fpreventing future deaths report to the
OL,16,FUK and Welsh government with her
OL,17,Fconcerns about how Cai had fallen
OL,18,Fvictim to the scam.
